                    <hi rendition="#italic">Post</hi>, <ref target="#pg784">p. 784</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d562-f2" n="79" xml:id="d562-f2-content">
                <p>For correspondence regarding the establishment of the Political-Military
                    Commission, see <ref target="#pg782">pp. 782</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d562-f3" n="80" xml:id="d562-f3-content">
                <p>See telegram No. 6368, October 13, 1 p.m., to the Ambassador in the United
                    Kingdom, and footnote 41, <ref target="#pg795">p. 795</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d562-f4" n="81" xml:id="d562-f4-content">
                <p>In a note to the Chargé dated October 18, 1943, Mr. Molotov acknowledged receipt
                    of the letter and stated that he had delivered the message to Marshal
                    Stalin.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
